> "In lending, as in life, the smartest move isn't always saying yes. It's knowing who else can."

## Michael's Memo: Knowing When to Bring in the Right Advisor

Isn't that quote profoundly true?

There are moments when a company needs extra "stretch capital" for a situational need. The business may already have a bank facility, or it may not yet qualify for bank financing. In either scenario, Serve Funding is here to support you and your growing firm.

When you engage us, you align with a servant leader and a solutions-minded advisor. We're grateful to walk alongside you in these seasons.

Let's keep growing,

Michael Kodinsky, Founder & CEO

## Creative Capital Solution: A Flexible Line of Credit Built for Today's Needs

This month we're featuring a subordinated line of credit that can be an exceptional non-bank tool for businesses seeking flexible capital beyond their bank's comfort zone. It supports growth while maintaining transparency and structured repayment discipline.

**Product snapshot, as offered in mid-2025:**

- Revolving line of credit
- Term: up to 36 months
- Rates: as low as 1.16% to 1.24% per month, never higher than 1.29%
- Payment frequency: weekly standard, monthly available on request
- Draw fees: 2.49% to 2.99%, with a minimum $10K draw within 30 days
- Security: personal guarantee plus UCC

**What makes it powerful:** this line isn't just a supplement to a traditional term loan. In the right situation it can be the better option altogether, especially when speed, flexibility, and draw control matter.

- Ideal for bridge scenarios, receivables gaps, or scaling inventory cycles
- An amortization schedule is provided for clarity and predictability

{% callout type="info" title="Pricing moves" %}
The terms above reflect one lender's program at the time this issue went out. Pricing and structure change with the market, so treat this as an example of what's possible rather than a current quote.
{% /callout %}

## More Than Money: Core Value of the Month, Service

At Serve Funding, our name is our mission.

Service isn't just something we deliver. It's how we lead. Whether you're a business owner navigating growth or guiding your company through a complex pivot, we show up with one goal: to serve your best interests, every time, in every conversation.

That means:

- Listening first, before recommending a solution
- Acting with urgency and care
- Prioritizing long-term outcomes over short-term wins
- Being accountable, not just when deals go smoothly but especially when they don't

We don't just provide funding. We help businesses and relationships thrive. Because when we put service first, trust follows, and so does growth.
